          <p align="center"><font color="#000000">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></p>
          <b><font face="Arial" size="2" color="#000000">CHAOS T4C SERVER</font></b><font color="#000000"><br>
          <img border="0" height="256" src="../t4c/Images/chaos3.jpg" width="192"><font face="Arial" size="2"><b><br>
          CHAOS T4C SERVER<br>
          SERVER ADDRESS: chaos.gamerealm.com<br>
          <br>
          </b></font><a href="http://www.sitepowerup.com/mb/view.asp?BoardID=116949" target="_top"><font face="Arial" size="2"><b>Chaos
          Board</b><br>
          <br>
          <br>
          </font></a><font face="Arial" size="2"><a href="http://t4c.isomedia.com/t4csignup/addchaosuser.asp" target="_top"><b>Chaos
          Sign Up<br>
          <br>
          </b></a><b>NEW CHAOS EXTREME<br>
          </b>Chaos Server is becoming a proving ground for who's the best of
          the best! When the new Isle is released there will be a defining way
          to end the game for a player (We don't want to give the details away,
          players must discover it on their own but rest assured there will be
          no doubt if you have reached this point) and the first player to bring
          this about (again we are having to be vague about the details) will be
          declared <b>The Best T4C Player in the World</b> and will hold a spot
          in the gamerealm Hall of Fame (soon to be built) as well as be
          rewarded with $100 and we will allow the player to move their account
          to our Main T4C Server (we will allow the Top 10 players to move their
          characters over to our Main T4C Server).<br>
          <b><br>
          </b>Once we find out who is the Best T4C Player in the World, Chaos
          Server will be wiped (We are guessing it will be another 7 months to a
          year before this will happen) and we will start all over again!<br>
          <br>
          So let Chaos Rule and only the Best will Survive!<br>
          <b><br>
          <br>
          </b>Think you are the best T4C player? Wanna prove it? In the next
          month gamerealm is opening a brand new server, Chaos Server.<br>
          <br>
          What's the big deal you ask? Chaos Server will be unlike any other T4C
          server out there and this server is only for the best of the best!
          Chaos is going to be an extremely hard server to play on, Chaos will
          not be for the weak of heart! Chaos will have the following settings,
          at least 10% exp loss for death by monsters, full backpack and
          equipped item loss on death by monsters, 0% exp loss for death by PK,
          full backpack and equipped item loss for death by PK. There will be NO
          PK range, NO RULES (Beyond basic rules, no bug abuse, etc) and there
          will be NO SHOUTS (pages only). GM Interaction will be zero! (There
          will be GM's to help with any in-game problems) Chaos Server will be
          ALL OUT WAR! There will be NO TRANSFERS on Chaos, all characters on
          Chaos will be built from the ground up, rest assured if you play on
          Chaos, you are are playing with the T4C Elite! If you think you have
          what it takes to be the best on the hardest T4C Server ever to be made
          <a href="../signup.asp">Sign Up</a> now! We hope to have Chaos up and
          running by March 16, 2000.<b><br>
          </b><br>
          <br>
          Chaos Server went live <b>NOT YET LIVE</b><br>
          <br>
          To connect to our server you must have an account with gamerealm,
          please fill out the <a href="http://www.gamerealm.com/T4C/signup.asp" target="_top">Sign
          Up</a> form if you wish to make an account. Make sure you download the
          game at <a href="http://www.gamerealm.com/t4c/downloads.htm" target="_top">Downloads</a>.
          You will need a copy of the game to play.<br>
          <br>
          Open your T4C client and in the Server name field type<br>
          <b>chaos.isomedia.com<br>
          </b><br>
          then put in your username and password<br>
          <i>*note your username and password must be in all lower case*<br>
          </i><br>
          <b>PK LAWS<br>
          NONE!<br>
          <br>
          <u>SETTINGS<br>
          </u><br>
          Min Level to PK: </b>1st Level<br>
          <b>PK Level Range: </b>No Level Range<br>
          <b>EXP Loss: </b>0%<br>
          <b>Backpack Loss:</b> 100%<br>
          <b>Equipped Item Loss: </b>100%<br>
          <br>
          <b>Exp Loss for Death By Monsters:</b> 100% of last level<br>
          <b>Backpack Loss for Death By Monsters: </b>100%<br>
          <b>Equipped Item Loss for Death By Monsters: </b>100%<br>
          <br>
          <b><u>PK ALLOWED AREAS</u><br>
          </b>ANYWHERE GAME ALLOWS<br>
          *note this does not include Bugged Areas*<br>
          *LightHaven and Temples are all meant to be safe Ground*<br>
          <br>
          <br>
          <b><u>Rules for CHAOS</u></b></font></font>
          <p><font color="#000000" face="Arial" size="2"><a href="terms&amp;agreement.asp" target="_top">Terms
          &amp; Agreement</a> for <a href="http://www.gamerealm.com" target="_top">gamerealm</a><br>
          <br>
          <b>GENERAL RULES<br>
          </b>No Bug Abuse!&nbsp;<br>
          No Text Macros to Lag out another player or to advance your character
          in a unfair manner! (you may not use macros to repeat a command or set
          of words, etc, over and over).<br>
          <br>
          please report any problem to <a href="mailto:sbenson@gamerealm.com">sbenson@gamerealm.com</a>&nbsp;</font></p>
